;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Big Trouble in Little China: The Game
; Character and stage roster
;
; Each line is:  character, stage, optional params
; The "order" param feeds the arcade ladder: arcade.maxmatches in [Options]
; lists how many opponents to take from order=1, order=2, and so on.
;
; Forty-eight fighters, in the order the film's cast list runs, then the seven
; placeholder slots and the randomselect that put RANDOM under the wall instead
; of inside it: the wall is eight portraits across and six down, and every cell
; of it is a fighter. Names are the characters' - no performer is credited
; anywhere in the game.
;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

[Characters]
